SUMMARY:Spring Break at the Columbia Gorge Discovery Center & Museum
DESCRIPTION:Make the most of Spring Break with hands-on learning and fun at the Columbia Gorge Discovery Center & Museum! \nFrom March 23–27\, join us each day from 9:00 AM to 1:00 PM for a variety of engaging activities\, crafts\, and interactive experiences designed to spark curiosity and creativity in young learners. \nAs an added bonus\, admission is free for youth ages 18 and under from March 21 through April 5\, making it the perfect time for families to visit\, explore\, and learn together.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/spring-break-at-the-columbia-gorge-discovery-center-museum/2026-03-31/
