SUMMARY:Spring Storytimes at Bridgeport Village
DESCRIPTION:Spring Storytime with Olive the Bookworm\nMarch 31 and April 1 & 2\n11am to 12pm \nJoin us for a delightful Spring Storytime featuring Olive the Bookworm! Embark on an imaginative storytime series filled with creativity\, laughter\, and plenty of literary fun. It’s the perfect way to introduce your little ones to the wonderful world of books and spark a lifelong love of reading. \nSpecial Guest Alert!\nThe Easter Bunny will hop in for a special appearance during the April 2 storytime. Be sure to stop by this extra-special celebration! \n📍 Storytimes are held inside Barnes & Noble at Bridgeport Village on Level 2 near the children’s book area.\nStroller parking will be available in a designated area for your convenience.\nWe can’t wait to read with you this spring! \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
